  "claim": "The superhero Thor is followed in the American comic novel series that started as a horror comics anthology and introduced the fictional realm based on Norse mythology.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Asgard (comics). Sentence: Based on the realm of the same name from Norse mythology, Asgard is home to the Asgardians and other beings adapted from Norse mythology.\nPage: Asgard (comics). Sentence: Asgard first appeared in \"Journey into Mystery\" #83 (October 1962) by Stan Lee, Larry Lieber and Jack Kirby, and features prominently in stories that follow the Marvel Comics superhero, Thor.\nPage: Journey into Mystery. Sentence: Journey into Mystery is an American comic book series initially published by Atlas Comics, then by its successor, Marvel Comics.\nPage: Journey into Mystery. Sentence: Initially a horror comics anthology, it segued to giant-monster and science fiction stories in the late 1950s.",
